    "authoritativeText": [
      {"lesson": "geo910-c2-s1-n43", "exercise": "14", "text": "14. 向量 $\\vec a=(p,q,r)$ 同基底向量 $\\vec i$、$\\vec j$、$\\vec k$ 的夹角分别是 $\\alpha$、$\\beta$、$\\gamma$（图5）.\n1) 证明：方向与向量 $\\vec a$ 相同的单位向量的坐标为 $(\\cos\\alpha,\\cos\\beta,\\cos\\gamma)$.\n2) 证明等式：$\\cos^2\\alpha+\\cos^2\\beta+\\cos^2\\gamma=1$.\n3) 如果 $\\alpha=\\beta=60^\\circ$，计算 $\\gamma$."}
    ],
    "inventory": [
      {
        "id": "s05-shared-frame",
        "description": "SOURCE: One unmarked common tail; four solid outward arrows i down-left,j right,k up,a upper-right, with overhead-vector labels and no separate dots or numeric givens. MODERN: Hidden labelled tip anchors and exact shared [0,0]; screen-only displacements are not spatial metrics.",
        "objects": ["i-tip", "j-tip", "k-tip", "a-tip", "i-vector", "j-vector", "k-vector", "a-vector"],
        "assertions": ["connect-i", "connect-j", "connect-k", "connect-a", "projection-i-j", "projection-j-k", "projection-k-a", "four-vectors"],
        "requires": ["pointRelationships"]
      },
      {
        "id": "s05-direction-angles",
        "description": "SOURCE: Three thin solid unarrowed spatial-angle traces and Greek alpha,beta,gamma: alpha links i-a across projected k, beta links j-a on the right, gamma links k-a above; no degree values or solutions. MODERN: Separate native circular schematic traces, not copied screen curvature or true 3D angle measurements. All endpoint rays and all four labelled tips are covered independently of arc count.",
        "objects": ["i-tip", "j-tip", "k-tip", "a-tip", "alpha-arc", "beta-arc", "gamma-arc", "alpha-label", "beta-label", "gamma-label"],
        "assertions": ["projection-i-j", "projection-j-k", "projection-k-a", "alpha-start-ray", "alpha-end-ray", "beta-start-ray", "beta-end-ray", "gamma-start-ray", "gamma-end-ray", "three-angle-arcs"],
        "requires": ["pointRelationships"]
      }
    ]
  },
